---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="How It Works - Alberti Home Buyers LLC">
  <section class="py-16 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-12">How Our Process Works</h1>

      <div class="space-y-12">
        <div class="card">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-brand-purple">Step 1: Submit Your Property Information</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">
            Start by filling out our simple form with basic information about your property. It takes just a few minutes. We'll use this information to conduct an initial assessment.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600">
            No personal commitment required. We're just getting to know your situation.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-brand-purple">Step 2: Property Inspection</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">
            One of our experienced home buyers will contact you within 24 hours to schedule a time to visit your property.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600">
            We'll conduct a thorough walkthrough and assessment. You're welcome to be present during the inspection.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-brand-purple">Step 3: Receive Your Cash Offer</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">
            Based on our assessment, we'll present you with a fair cash offer. This offer is firm and not contingent on appraisals or financing.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600">
            Take your time to consider it. There's no pressure to accept immediately.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-brand-purple">Step 4: Close on Your Timeline</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">
            If you accept our offer, we handle all the paperwork and details. You choose when you want to close – whether that's in 7 days or 7 weeks.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600">
            You'll walk away with cash in your pocket. No commissions. No fees.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 bg-brand-purple text-white p-10 rounded-2xl text-center shadow-xl">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Ready to Get Started?</h3>
        <a href="/" class="inline-block btn-primary px-8 py-3">
          Get Your Free Offer
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
